      <activity id="cab70fb5-cb54-5454-bcd2-2419669a7ffe" activityNameId="20a512a9-5718-5d67-9a78-e2df43724ae9" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Aluminium collector foil production, for Li-ion battery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Aluminium collector foil production, for Li-ion battery
The activity starts with aluminium alloy and chemicals entering the factory. The activity ends with the production of aluminium current collector foil at the factory gate; UUID: a6a4da99-9335-3472-a862-86ef80f3b50f
The dataset represents the production of 1 kg aluminium foil to be used as current collector for the positive electrode (cathode) in Lithium-ion battery. Input materials for pre-treatment, infrastructure and waste are included; The dataset has been partly extrapolated from Notter et al. (2010).
Location: Data for global average aluminium collector foils
Technology: Al collector foil for Lithium ion batteries.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a6a4da99-9335-3472-a862-86ef80f3b50f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
